ls you can use with your own OFS-based shell design.\r\n\r\nWhat's new in the ofs-2024.1-1 release?\r\n\r\n* New DMA Workload (AFU) that allows you to test moving data between host memory and FPGA local memory.  See the [DMA folder](https://github.com/OFS/examples-afu/tree/main/tutorial/afu_types/01_pim_ifc/dma)."}]